# Doc Audit History

Project-level, append-only — lives at `~/.claude/sdd-memory/<project-slug>/DOC-AUDIT-HISTORY.md`,
alongside `DOC-AUDIT-STATE.md`. Mirrors `REVIEW-HISTORY.md.template`'s shape. Never edit or
remove prior entries.

